<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/dataPreprocessing> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A free-form text that describes the various preprocessing steps\nthat were applied to the raw data to create the dataset.\n\nExamples include standardization, normalization, deduplication, tokenization, and removal of tokens."@en .
